WEBVTT

1
00:00.600 --> 00:02.500
Deaf people don't have the space they deserve.

2
00:03.100 --> 00:05.300
No space in a country's culture,

3
00:05.600 --> 00:08.500
no space in education, or in society.

4
00:09.300 --> 00:12.800
Turning this story around is Derdic's mission.

5
00:13.200 --> 00:18.000
An institution that helps deaf people live better

6
00:18.000 --> 00:23.300
in a world that has never given them space.

7
00:24.600 --> 00:28.400
So that one day you'll see deaf people in the place they deserve,

8
00:28.900 --> 00:30.050
not in some corner.
